---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Statement vs WAL vs logical log for UPDATE users SET last_seen = NOW() WHERE id = 7. Values illustrative.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-label="One change, three ways to describe it. Statement-based sends the SQL itself, and NOW() gives a different time on the follower. WAL shipping sends the bytes changed in a disk block, so the follower needs the same storage format. Logical replication sends the changed row with its final value, which works across versions.">
    <rect x="10" y="10" width="280" height="306" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="24" y="36" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>Statement-based</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Theo câu lệnh</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="64" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>The leader writes in the log:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Leader ghi vào log:</tspan></text>
    <rect x="24" y="74" width="252" height="56" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="36" y="98" class="t-mono">UPDATE users SET last_seen =</text>
    <text x="36" y="116" class="t-mono">NOW() WHERE id = 7</text>
    <line x1="150.0" y1="134.0" x2="150.0" y2="161.0" class="edge " /><polygon points="150.0,170.0 154.5,161.0 145.5,161.0" class="head " />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={44} y={196} size={26} />
    <text x="70" y="190" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>The follower</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower</tspan></text>
    <text x="70" y="208" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>runs it again at 10:00:04.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy lại lúc 10:00:04.</tspan></text>
    <text x="70" y="225" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Leader stored 10:00:01.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Leader đã lưu 10:00:01.</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="290" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>The copies can differ</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai bản có thể khác nhau</tspan></text>
    <rect x="310" y="10" width="280" height="306" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="324" y="36" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>WAL shipping</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Gửi WAL</tspan></text>
    <text x="324" y="64" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>The leader writes in the log:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Leader ghi vào log:</tspan></text>
    <rect x="324" y="74" width="252" height="56" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="336" y="98" class="t-mono">block 812, offset 40:</text>
    <text x="336" y="116" class="t-mono">write bytes 5F 3A 91 C2</text>
    <line x1="450.0" y1="134.0" x2="450.0" y2="161.0" class="edge " /><polygon points="450.0,170.0 454.5,161.0 445.5,161.0" class="head " />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={344} y={196} size={26} />
    <text x="370" y="190" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>The follower</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower</tspan></text>
    <text x="370" y="208" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>writes the same bytes into</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ghi cùng các byte vào</tspan></text>
    <text x="370" y="225" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>the same block of its file.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cùng block trong file của nó.</tspan></text>
    <text x="324" y="290" class="t-ok"><tspan data-lang-en>Identical copy, same format only</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bản sao y hệt, chỉ cùng định dạng</tspan></text>
    <rect x="610" y="10" width="280" height="306" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <text x="624" y="36" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>Logical (row-based)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Logic (theo dòng)</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="64" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>The leader writes in the log:</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Leader ghi vào log:</tspan></text>
    <rect x="624" y="74" width="252" height="56" rx="4" class="box strong" />
    <text x="636" y="98" class="t-mono">row id = 7:</text>
    <text x="636" y="116" class="t-mono">last_seen = 10:00:01</text>
    <line x1="750.0" y1="134.0" x2="750.0" y2="161.0" class="edge " /><polygon points="750.0,170.0 754.5,161.0 745.5,161.0" class="head " />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={644} y={196} size={26} />
    <text x="670" y="190" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>The follower</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower</tspan></text>
    <text x="670" y="208" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>sets last_seen on row 7</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đặt last_seen của dòng 7</tspan></text>
    <text x="670" y="225" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>to 10:00:01.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thành 10:00:01.</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="290" class="t-ok"><tspan data-lang-en>Same values, any version</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng giá trị, mọi phiên bản</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The same change, written into the log three ways. Values and block numbers are illustrative.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cùng một thay đổi, được ghi vào log theo ba cách. Giá trị và số block chỉ để minh hoạ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
